g-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex","line":12,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"1c61ee34a2e5ffcb1eb9c36739825a34bbd0424c6c18b9ac8760d7980a26a43a","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:edcef2babb056bfc685107a6bc5f44d1b622a17a6a6e7862e5dddcf337d48e01","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex#L12"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor every fixed real $0<\\delta<1/3$, there is a deterministic\npolynomial-time algorithm $R_\\delta$ that maps each explicitly encoded\nBoolean $3$-CNF formula $\\phi$ to a nonempty finite simple undirected\nunweighted graph $G_\\phi$ such that\n\\[\n \\begin{array}{ll}\n \\phi\\text{ is satisfiable}\n   &\\Longrightarrow G_\\phi\\text{ is three-colorable},\\\\[2pt]\n \\phi\\text{ is unsatisfiable}\n   &\\Longrightarrow \\alpha(G_\\phi)<\\delta\\,|V(G_\\phi)|.\n \\end{array}\n\\]\nThe running time and explicit output size are polynomial in the ordinary\nbinary encoding length of $\\phi$. Their constants and polynomial degree\nmay depend on the fixed $\\delta$, but not on $\\phi$.\nThe coloring in the first implication covers every vertex and is not\nsupplied with the graph."},{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:b955590bc5ee12ad629147e0c436ca418b220671af887daee171bc62f4cff4d6","grain":"paper-statement","id":"Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026#cor:coloring"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/f5bf33cf821cc3e60abbff61.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Corollary","id":"r:Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026:cor:coloring","manuscript_id":"p:Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026","name":"cor:coloring","printed_number":"1.2","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","binding":{"file":"build/source/sections/introduction.tex","label":"cor:coloring","line":48,"manuscript":"Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026","statement_sha256":"c0d7a3282ed7dcff1dcaa72bcd4675478febc71faf4209aa14dc78a8a086ede8"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","renderer":"scripts/build_papers.py","source":"data/statement_numbers.json","upstream_pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb"},"printed_number_status":"recorded","reading_page":"papers/Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026.html#cor:coloring","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","file":"preprints/Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex","line":48,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"c0d7a3282ed7dcff1dcaa72bcd4675478febc71faf4209aa14dc78a8a086ede8","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Hardness-of-finding-large-independent-sets-in-three-colorable-graphs-September-24-2026